{"unit_id":"jxb01__godot-tools-dsh-plugin#card-zh","repo":"jxb01/godot-tools-dsh-plugin","commit":"f4f527f6e1234c6a073a50eca0e0dc4dcfbe18cd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"godot-tools-dsh-plugin 是面向 DSH Web 的本地 Godot 4.x Agent 工具插件。它通过 DSH 工具注册接口接入，可检查项目并导入资源、无头运行场景或 GDScript、列出项目资源，也能启动 Godot 编辑器。用户可在会话中启用或停用这些工具，适合需要让 DSH 辅助验证和操作 Godot 项目的开发者。运行时需要本机 Godot 可执行文件；可通过 godotExe 配置路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["godot-tools.js:56-60","godot-tools.js:105-224","godot-tools.js:256-293"]}
{"unit_id":"jxb01__godot-tools-dsh-plugin#card-en","repo":"jxb01/godot-tools-dsh-plugin","commit":"f4f527f6e1234c6a073a50eca0e0dc4dcfbe18cd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"godot-tools-dsh-plugin adds local Godot tools to DSH Web. It checks projects, imports assets, runs scenes or GDScript headlessly, lists project files, and launches the editor. Developers can toggle the tools during a session. A local Godot executable is required; set its path with godotExe.","source":"generated","evidence":["godot-tools.js:56-60","godot-tools.js:105-224","godot-tools.js:256-293"]}
