{"unit_id":"jxb01__godot-tools-dsh-plugin#feature-check","repo":"jxb01/godot-tools-dsh-plugin","commit":"f4f527f6e1234c6a073a50eca0e0dc4dcfbe18cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"godot-tools-dsh-plugin 的功能「项目无头检查」：调用 Godot 对指定项目导入资源并运行首帧，返回退出状态和引擎输出。通过 godot_check 工具传入项目目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["godot-tools.js:105-115"]}
{"unit_id":"jxb01__godot-tools-dsh-plugin#feature-import","repo":"jxb01/godot-tools-dsh-plugin","commit":"f4f527f6e1234c6a073a50eca0e0dc4dcfbe18cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"godot-tools-dsh-plugin 的功能「资源重导入」：以无头模式重新导入指定 Godot 项目的全部资源，并返回执行状态和输出。通过 godot_import 工具传入项目目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["godot-tools.js:117-126"]}
{"unit_id":"jxb01__godot-tools-dsh-plugin#feature-run","repo":"jxb01/godot-tools-dsh-plugin","commit":"f4f527f6e1234c6a073a50eca0e0dc4dcfbe18cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"godot-tools-dsh-plugin 的功能「运行场景或脚本」：可无头运行指定场景若干帧，或执行 GDScript 并捕获打印输出和退出码。分别调用 godot_run_scene 或 godot_run_script。","source":"generated","evidence":["godot-tools.js:128-161"]}
{"unit_id":"jxb01__godot-tools-dsh-plugin#feature-assets_editor","repo":"jxb01/godot-tools-dsh-plugin","commit":"f4f527f6e1234c6a073a50eca0e0dc4dcfbe18cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"godot-tools-dsh-plugin 的功能「资源浏览与编辑器启动」：递归列出项目中的场景、脚本和资源，或启动 Godot 编辑器。分别使用 godot_list_assets 和 godot_open_editor。","source":"generated","evidence":["godot-tools.js:163-224"]}
